{% doc %}
Price and protein per glass, readable on a phone without swiping.
@param {string} [number] - Chapter number.
@param {string} [sources_href] - Link to the full sourced comparison.
{% enddoc %}
<section class="jcs-versus" id="jc-versus" aria-labelledby="jc-versus-title">
  <div class="jcs-frame">
    <p class="jcs-chapter"><span>{{ number | default: '04' }}</span>Por vaso de 200 ml</p>
    <div class="jcs-versus__head">
      <h2 class="jcs-title" id="jc-versus-title">Hicimos las cuentas.</h2>
      <p class="jcs-lead">La almendra no salió bien parada. NUBE frente a tres bebidas de almendras sin endulzar, en precio y proteína por vaso.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="jcs-versus__rows" role="table" aria-label="Precio y proteína por vaso de 200 ml">
      <div class="jcs-versus__row jcs-versus__row--nube" role="row">
        <div class="jcs-versus__name" role="cell"><strong>NUBE</strong><span>{{ 'jc_comparison.nube_pack' | t }}</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>6,3 g</strong><span>Proteína</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>$1.330</strong><span>Por vaso</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="jcs-versus__row" role="row">
        <div class="jcs-versus__name" role="cell"><strong>Almendra · económica</strong><span>{{ 'jc_comparison.d1_pack' | t }}</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>1,0 g</strong><span>Proteína</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>$1.650</strong><span>Por vaso</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="jcs-versus__row" role="row">
        <div class="jcs-versus__name" role="cell"><strong>Almendra · precio medio</strong><span>{{ 'jc_comparison.nh_pack' | t }}</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>0,8 g</strong><span>Proteína</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>≈ $3.425</strong><span>Por vaso</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="jcs-versus__row" role="row">
        <div class="jcs-versus__name" role="cell"><strong>Almendra · precio alto</strong><span>{{ 'jc_comparison.silk_pack' | t }}</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>0,8 g</strong><span>Proteína</span></div>
        <div class="jcs-versus__num" role="cell"><strong>≈ $4.429</strong><span>Por vaso</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="jcs-versus__notes">
      <span>Precios de referencia consultados el 3 de noviembre de 2026. NUBE: 1 barra + agua hasta 200 ml, según su etiqueta.</span>
      <a class="jcs-link" href="{{ sources_href | default: '/products/nube#jc-nutrition' }}">Fuentes y cálculo <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
